{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 46, :comments ["<b>והתנחלתם [you shall hold them as an inheritance].</b> From the hitpa'el binyan; like it is והתאויתם [you shall covet for yourselves]." "<b>לעולם בהם תעבודו [you shall work them forever].</b> They are permitted only as we find that the Sages said: it is a commandment — we have accepted it." "And the sense of <b>ובאחיכם בני ישראל [and among your brothers, the children of Israel].</b> Is that you shall make a distinction between your brother and the foreigner."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:12:31.212491904Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}